---
description: loop, alt with else, opt, par with and, critical with option, break
---
sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Client
  participant S as Server
  participant D as Database
  loop every minute
    C->>S: poll
  end
  alt cache hit
    S-->>C: cached
  else cache miss
    S->>D: query
    D-->>S: rows
  end
  opt logging on
    S->>S: write log
  end
  par to the client
    S-->>C: done
  and to the database
    S->>D: commit
  end
  critical open a connection
    S->>D: connect
  option timeout
    S->>S: retry
  end
  break when the server fails
    S-->>C: error
  end
